WEBVTT

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.640
I don't know how to get back.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.370
What should I do?

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.440
And my phone isn't getting any signal.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.840
A Western-style house by 
the side of the forest.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.550
A girl who appears when night falls.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:45.270
Her appearance remains unchanged, 
no matter how many years pass.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:50.140
One theory says that she's 
a doll with a soul.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.250
A doll-girl?

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.900
The word "doll" got her attention!

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:58.070
There's also a story about a 
girl who roams the forest,

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:01.270
and a story of a girl floating in the sky.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.110
Are you researching this 
for the occult club?

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.180
Yup.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.600
Wow, a doll-girl!

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.440
Th-That's just an urban legend!

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.500
Look at this.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.000
<i>I came here thinking that 
I could see that girl</i>

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.000
<i>if I found this place, but...</i>

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.370
<i>I-Is that an animal?</i>

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.750
<i>Or...</i>

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.040
A girl?

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:53.990
She's so pretty...

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:58.290
<i>But what is she doing in 
the middle of the forest?</i>

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:00.720
Don't be afraid.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:04.350
I'm just your run-of-the-mill 
vampire passing by.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:06.180
Nobody suspicious.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.400
<i>Totally suspicious.</i>

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.760
U-Um, I lost my way.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.480
You came all the way out here?

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.850
That's rare.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:18.220
I don't know which way to go!

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.050
All right, then, grab on.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.190
See? If you go from above, you can't get lost.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.840
Wow, you really are a vampire!

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:14.480
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:14.480
<b>Ordinary Citizen of the Dark</b>

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:21.960
So what are you doing 
in this forsaken place?

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:23.860
Actually...

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.540
There's this place called 
"The Doll Mansion."

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.450
I was looking for it.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.240
Oh. That's my house.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:33.330
Really?!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.580
It's closer to the town, though.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:40.880
But the rumors all say it's by the forest.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.970
Oh, that's right.

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:50.160
A young girl like you can't just go 
wandering around alone at night!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.910
The Mori family lives next to me.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.650
It's a family whose <i>name</i> means "forest"?!

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.040
If you're curious, you can take a look.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.370
Really?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:03.290
Vampires don't age, so if they 
live in one place for a long time,

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.490
strange rumors tend to start spreading.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.020
Oh. That sounds rough.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.650
I don't really care about the rumors.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.910
The bigger problem...

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:14.810
Huh?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:18.870
...is that Mori-san keeps 
bringing food over to me.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:22.260
You need to eat if you want 
to grow up big and strong.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.890
I don't eat anything but blood.

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.430
Those weird diets are no good.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.710
You also need your meat and vegetables!

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.420
I don't want the food to go to waste,

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:33.750
but she doesn't seem to 
understand when I explain it.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.880
That does sound like a problem.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.140
Here we are.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:44.020
It's just like the photo 
Sakuya-chan showed me!

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.020
You can come in if you want.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.070
Sure!

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.610
Thank you for having m—

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:56.180
Oh, wow!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.540
It's so vampiriffic!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.070
Glad to hear it.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:05.750
So you heard the rumors and came 
here on a dare or something?

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.920
Actually, I came out here...

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.430
to capture the doll-girl!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.800
You're more aggressive than you look.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.590
So what's your name?

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:20.470
My name is Amano Akari.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:25.300
My name is Sophie Twilight.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:28.120
Oh! So you're Sophie-chan.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:31.700
You know, I just love dolls.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:36.390
I was thinking it would be so wonderful 
if a moving doll really did exist.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.030
Sorry I'm not a doll.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:45.010
Looking at you, though, 
you look exactly like my ideal doll.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.700
Skin like porcelain...

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.730
Hair like silk...

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.610
Lithe calves!

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:54.460
You really do look just like a live doll!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.630
Hey, are you all right?

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:00.000
Hey, Sophie-chan, can I pet you?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.900
<b>Pant Pant Pant</b>

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.030
Can I take you home?

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.910
I want to comb your hair and dress you!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.850
Uh... Stay away. You're scaring me.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.030
<b>Shock</b>

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:10.870
I'm a normal human, and a 
vampire is scared of me!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:15.850
Hey, Sophie-chan... It's really late.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.840
Would you mind if I stayed the night?

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.570
I don't mind.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.570
You're not scared to stay 
over at a vampire's house?

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:23.780
It's fine!

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:27.420
If it's you, even having my blood 
sucked out would be a treat!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.700
<i>She's not going to try anything 
funny while she's here, right?</i>

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.620
<i>I'm not so sure about this anymore.</i>

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.480
Sh-Should we have dinner, then?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.340
D-Dinner?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.640
I-I guess so.

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:47.760
Just a little, okay?

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:51.500
I don't drink from live 
humans. That's scary.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.290
I'm not a weirdo.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.320
<b>Shock</b>

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.920
I scared a vampire again!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.870
I happened to have some food Mori-san gave me.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.930
It smells delicious!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.500
You drink blood from a tea cup, huh?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.320
How elegant!

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:10.120
Right.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.010
Oh, you warm up the blood in the microwave.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.910
600 watts, for fifty seconds or so.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.260
Really?

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.860
<i>Wow... She's a vampire, but 
she's a totally ordinary person.</i>

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.850
<b>Tune in again next week</b>

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:30.460
As a nocturnal person, I can't help 
watching late-night anime.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:38.580
Anime Board

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:38.580
<b>Comments (192) 
</b>1. AnimeLover-san 
2. AnimeLover-san 
3. AnimeLover-san

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:36.680
I bet everyone writing reviews 
around this hour is a vampire, too.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.560
I don't think so...

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:40.880
When you say "nocturnal,"

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.920
does that mean vampires really 
don't go out during the day?

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:44.870
Right.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.690
I don't handle the sunlight well,

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:49.340
so I don't go out during the day 
unless it's really important.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.840
I see!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.580
Oh, there's an autograph 
session with the author.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.000
From 1:00 to 3:00 pm.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.010
<b>The autograph session with Surume-sensei 
is finally this Sunday!</b>

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.220
All right!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.240
Next Sunday, I'm going out!

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.130
Wait, that's something "really important"?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.230
Hey, don't they also say 
that vampires can't enter

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.550
a place unless someone invites them in?

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:10.700
That's right. We can't.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:15.530
So is it like, they're repelled by some 
kind of barrier that keeps them out,

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:19.920
or they <i>can</i> enter, but it does some 
kind of damage that hurts them?

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:24.410
Actually, we can still physically enter 
a place, even without an invitation.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.450
But if we do...

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.780
What happens?

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:32.860
The people who lived there would 
think we were completely rude.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:35.760
We'd be consumed by guilt.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.790
That's such a normal reason!

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:43.650
So this is your room!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.580
You really do sleep in a coffin, huh?

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.490
I wonder what it's like inside.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:51.480
Huh?

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:58.730
<i>I probably shouldn't have looked 
in there without permission.</i>

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.450
Bye-bye, Sophie-chan!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:03.770
Bye.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:05.910
See you next time!

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.380
Did she say "next time"?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.970
<i>After that, this human started 
to visit me every day.</i>

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:26.850
<b>Glom Glom</b>

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.470
<i>Honestly, it's a little annoying.</i>

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.850
<b>Maybe It's a Vampire!!!</b>

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.450
Wow, really?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:35.640
Hey, vampires are stronger 
than humans, right?

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:36.560
Yes.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:40.710
<i>I know! Maybe if I shock her 
by showing her my power,</i>

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.280
<i>I'll get my peace back.</i>

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.580
I can pick up a road roller just like that!

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:59.080
She ran away in such a panic.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.680
Maybe I scared her too much.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.980
But at least now I can go 
back to my quiet life.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:30.660
Hey, hey, Sophie-chan!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.210
I didn't think I'd miss 
someone that annoying,

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:38.430
but when I think she's never coming 
back, I actually feel sad...

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:47.890
Sophie-chan!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.010
Human? I thought you fled in terror...

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:56.000
These are all the jars and things 
that I couldn't open myself.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.940
I thought, with your strength...

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.130
So I hurried and grabbed 
them all from my house!

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:03.750
<i>I thought she feared me, but she 
was just finding a way to use me.</i>

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.860
I'm not like humans.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.950
Aren't you even a little scared of me?

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.720
Not a bit!

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.960
You helped me out the first time we met, too.

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:19.180
You can do so many amazing 
things that I can't do.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:24.310
So please, can I keep coming here?

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.960
You're a really strange human.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.470
My name isn't "human." It's Akari.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.260
Do as you like...

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.740
Akari.

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:41.110
Did you just say I can do whatever I like?!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.430
Then I want to brush your hair 
and put it into pigtails

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.640
and pet it, and then I want 
to take a bath together!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.400
Never mind, go home!

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:53.970
So now I'm going every day to visit 
my new friend who I met in the woods.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:54.950
Every day?

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:55.840
Yeah!

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:59.970
Wouldn't it be easier if you 
just moved in with her?

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.380
M-Move in with her?!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.770
You want her to move in 
with a complete stranger?

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:04.960
I was joking.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.220
I... I knew that!

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:10.800
So is your friend a boy or a girl?

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.290
A b-boy?!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.810
I-I'm not so sure that's a g-good thing!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.070
Good morning!

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:19.730
I came to see you, Sophie-chan!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.830
You're here early on your day off.

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:25.600
I figured if I came early,
you'd still be awake.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:28.510
Thank you for having me!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:30.170
Uh-huh...

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:35.070
Sophie-chan, it's a waste that you have 
your curtains drawn all the time.

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:38.740
The weather is nice today, so the 
morning sun is really beautiful!

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:40.060
See?

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:41.630
Indeed.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.110
Dying basked in light 
like this isn't so bad.

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:46.320
Oh, sorry!

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:47.920
You can't handle sunlight!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:52.690
So how come you brought 
all these bags today?

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:55.520
Well, I just had a thought...

00:13:56.740 --> 00:14:01.390
You live in this big house all alone, right?

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:05.860
So I was thinking I'd like to move in with you!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.560
But that's so sudden.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:09.620
Is that a no?

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.240
But I brought all my stuff.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.070
You're getting too far ahead.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.700
And what is all this stuff, anyway?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.350
Well...

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.010
I brought some clothes,

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:24.030
and my pajamas, and my toothbrush and towel.

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:26.510
Also...

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.660
I brought my dolls,

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:33.050
and clothes and hats for my dolls.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.010
So most of it is doll stuff?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.810
Hmm... It's true that there are 
some extra rooms here, but...

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.660
It won't be a problem for me at all!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.100
This is also a lot closer to my school.

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.310
Your parents are okay with this?

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:50.560
Wouldn't they be worried if you 
said you were living with a vampire?

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.690
I guess I'll ask them.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.050
What?

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:56.840
You're going to live with your friend?

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.390
And their family is all right with that?

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.520
They live all alone?

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.940
Who is this friend?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.850
They turn into ash in the sunlight?

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.270
Oh, yeah! I love the sun!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.420
What? A vampire?!

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:15.470
<i>She looks like she's around thirteen,</i>

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.510
<i>and she's a beautiful girl with silver hair!</i>

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:19.150
Well, then, I'm all for it!

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.780
Invite her over to our house sometime.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:23.610
<b>Mom</b>

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:24.580
So that's that!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.880
Now it's all up to you.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:31.550
Let me guess. Your entire family 
is just like you, aren't they?

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:35.410
Why would you want to live 
with a vampire, anyway?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.480
It's dark all day, and it's 
not exactly comfortable.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.570
I want to because you're here!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:43.250
You said vampires don't age, right?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.000
Right.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:48.570
A girl who never ages is 
basically like a living doll!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:49.590
You're too close.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:55.670
If I live here, I can admire 
you every day, plus...

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:58.310
you won't be so lonely either, right?

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.920
It's not like I was lonely before.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:08.870
Is there anything inconvenient 
about living alone as a vampire?

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:13.480
Since you can't stand the sun, you can't 
go shopping during the day, right?

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:16.400
Sure, there are some inconvenient things.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:20.780
I don't like running water, 
so washing dishes was a problem.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:24.220
If I'm living here, you can leave 
all the shopping and dishes to me!

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:27.470
No, I mean, it was a problem in the past,

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:29.710
but now I have convenience 
stores and Amason.

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:33.220
I also bought a dishwasher, so I'm fine.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.550
These are convenient times.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.710
I hate you, technological advances!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.740
Okay, then...

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:46.460
If you let me live with you,

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:50.370
you can suck my blood whenever you like!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.200
The blood of a young maiden!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.260
Come, try it!

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:56.660
Stay away! I don't want any!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:02.070
I've always got plenty 
of blood in the fridge.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:06.830
<b>Tasty B</b>

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:06.830
<b>Rich AB</b>

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:06.830
<b>Mellow O</b>

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:06.830
<b>Simply A</b>

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:05.000
I would never suck your blood, of all people.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.830
"Of all people"? What's 
that supposed to mean?!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.090
Ta-da! I can also cook!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.440
Like meat and potato stew!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.400
Huh, that's impressive.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:16.050
I don't eat human food, though.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.850
Oh, that's right...

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.400
Ouch!

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.010
Be careful.

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:24.280
Don't waste it.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.470
Just one second, Sophie-chan.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:40.530
I'll get you more.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.330
No, stop.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:46.630
For someone who only drinks blood,

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.320
you sure have a lot of china and cutlery.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:51.200
I use different ones each 
time I won't get bored.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.570
When I have it hot, I'll drink it like soup,

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:56.650
or like tea, or like coffee.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:58.910
Cold, I drink it from a stein or a bottle.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.020
I see.

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.550
In summer, I freeze it 
and eat it like a popsicle.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.260
In winter, I warm it in a sake 
bottle and enjoy it like hot sake.

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:08.360
Wow, how elegant!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:14.100
Looks like I don't have 
a lot of type O left.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.150
I'm going to go buy some.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.180
Go... buy some?

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.720
Like hunting?!

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:21.990
<b>Hunting</b>

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:25.930
<i>I've been wondering where she 
gets all that blood from.</i>

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:30.800
<i>Since it's Sophie-can, I can't imagine 
she's harming anyone, but...</i>

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.500
There.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.040
I got express delivery, 
so it should be here tomorrow.

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.150
You buy it online?!

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:50.230
Okay, I'm going to clean now!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.900
Dust dust dust!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.260
Wipe wipe wipe!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:54.830
Sweep sweep sweep!

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.750
<i>She's really going at it today.</i>

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:56.600
Dust dust dust!

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.560
Oh, you were watching me?

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:03.700
<i>She's already so loud by default. 
I wish she could just act normal.</i>

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:09.120
<i>Still, with Akari around,</i>

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:12.200
<i>it feels like the house has brightened up.</i>

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.530
You won't be so lonely either, right?

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.200
<i>I guess she may be right.</i>

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.370
Hey, Sophie-chan.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:25.270
The light bulbs seemed really dim, 
so I switched them to brighter ones.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:26.840
Don't just change those!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:29.780
I picked them to make it more 
habitable for vampires!

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.860
<i>I guess I shouldn't have done that.</i>

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.810
<i>I wonder what I can do 
to get her to accept me.</i>

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:40.830
Akari,

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.700
I'm going to sleep now, so go home.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.530
I'm so sorry.

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:53.880
I know it's right before your 
bedtime and I'm just in the way.

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.740
<i>It didn't work out.</i>

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:59.560
Go home and properly pack your things.

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:03.590
I'll carry the heavy stuff once it's dark.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:04.910
Really?!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.680
I never said no.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:12.670
Then I'll gather up the fifty-five 
dolls that didn't fit into my bag!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:14.900
You're bringing more dolls over?

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.380
Woohoo!

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.820
We'll be together every day now!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:24.340
But how come?

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:29.320
I couldn't do anything useful for you.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:32.510
I never asked you to be useful to me.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:34.560
There were empty rooms here, anyway.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:39.560
Besides, it might be kind of fun...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.750
if you move in here.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.390
Sophie-chan!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.210
That means our love is mutual!

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:55.520
So we're going to get married...

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.640
That's way too big a leap!

00:20:57.640 --> 00:21:00.980
I don't have much to offer, 
but please be kind to me!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.910
I just agreed to this, but I'm 
already questioning my decision.

00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:18.250
See you later!

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.830
Good morning, Sophie-chan!

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:24.410
Good morning.

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.930
I'm going to school now!

00:22:26.930 --> 00:22:27.860
Okay.

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:34.670
Aw, I wish I could be with you at school, too.

00:22:34.670 --> 00:22:36.350
School, huh?

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:39.410
I did try to go to high 
school for a little bit.

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:41.220
Really?

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:44.880
I didn't want the people in the 
neighborhood to think I'm a NEET.

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:48.100
There was a big window that got a lot of sun.

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:51.140
Hey, Twilight, you can't 
wear a cloak in class!

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:52.550
And put that parasol away!

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:54.520
So many unreasonable rules.

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:56.770
No flying in the hallways!

00:22:57.330 --> 00:22:59.510
Violence in the guise of kindness.

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:01.880
What, you're only drinking juice for lunch?

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.990
That's not enough. You need to eat.

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:05.860
I'll give you some of my lunch.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.280
Here, have a potsticker.

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:10.070
<b>Garlic smell</b>

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.070
And spaghetti aglio e olio.

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:12.640
It was truly terrifying.

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:14.760
I lasted three days.

00:23:14.760 --> 00:23:16.010
I see.

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:18.710
I guess it's not easy being a vampire.

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:23.910
Hinata-chan!

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:25.950
Good morning!

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:27.570
Oh, Akari?

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:29.090
What are you doing here?

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:32.050
Well, you see...

00:23:34.670 --> 00:23:37.320
I guess I'll go to bed.
